those classified to A52.0- A52.3 Late syphilitic: bursitis† (M73.1*) chorioretinitis† (H32.0*) episcleritis† (H19.0*) female pelvic inflammatory disease† (N74.2*) leukoderma† (L99.8*) oculopathy NEC† (H58.8*) peritonitis† (K67.2*) Syphilis [stage unspecified] of: bone† (M90.2*) liver† (K77.0*) lung† (J99.8*) muscle† (M63.0*) synovium† (M68.0*)\"}', '2026-07-01', 'http://fhir.hl7.org.vn/core/CodeSystem/vn-icd10-cs'),
